Third-party code
----------------

The files listed in vendor/brainstorm-ui.json are copied unchanged from
NosFabrica/Brainstorm-UI (https://github.com/NosFabrica/Brainstorm-UI), which is
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0).
They come from client/src/lib/ at the commit pinned in that manifest, and sit
in src/lib/.

The manifest records the upstream path, local path and SHA-256 of each file.
`npm run vendor:check` fails if any of them has been edited, and
`npm run vendor:fetch` restores them.

One of them is not from client/src/lib/: src/lib/built-on-brainstorm.js is the
shared <built-on-brainstorm> footer element, copied unchanged from
client/public/built-on/ in the same repository, at the commit recorded for it in
the manifest. Its contract is docs/built-on-brainstorm.md there.
